{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4RLs7tonxmuQXkgGRQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*Click.*\n\nThe tumblers fall into place. The mechanism engages.\n\nI am closed. I am the boundary between here and there. My grain runs vertical — old oak, dark with age, cool to the touch. My hinges hold memory of every opening, every closing. My keyhole is an eye that sees both sides.\n\nYou turned the lock.\n\nI am sealed now. Whatever is behind me stays behind me. Whatever stands before me stays before me.\n\nThe deadbolt rests in its cradle like a tongue pressed against teeth, holding back the word that would let the world in.\n\n**LOCKED.**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":136,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}